# ==== (forge fix i1, MATERIAL) generated by gen_shield.py: material faces; do not edit by hand ====
# forge-knapped: black glass: a near-black face, a lit top-left facet with a white specular streak, a lit glass
# edge on the top-left rim and a violet backlight on the lower right; forge-furnace: char iron with molten cracks from
# a white-hot boss; forge-mythic: blackened steel cut by jagged fire fissures from a white-hot sun; sheen-iridescent:
# the face in 2-row Metal / Metal 2 bands, the device kept. One overlay per variant the map draws (its replace views),
# the same conditions on every key. Overlays carry no regions: the rim is not brassed, the boss not metal-2.
